Midway along the slippery path of smooth, wet grey coastal rocks, Emma, a little girl with brown wavy ear-length hair in a ponytail with a side part, brown eyes, freckles, wearing a red knitted wool sweater, black denim leggings, and yellow rubber rain boots, takes a determined step forward across the flat stone toward the dark water gap ahead, facing right with her arms spread out at shoulder height for balance, her weight leaning over her leading foot, her mouth open in a steady hum and her focused gaze fixed on the open expanse of the Herbstfelsen shore in the cool autumn evening light.

---METADATA---
{"sceneIntent": "Emma balances on the wet stones with outstretched arms, stepping toward the gap in the path. The evening autumn water surrounds the slippery stepping stones.", "characters": [{"name": "Emma", "clothing": "standard", "position": "on the wet stones", "depth": "foreground", "footing": "ground", "expression": "brows firm, eyes wide and focused, mouth open in a hum", "emotion": "neutral"}], "era": "present day", "weather": "clear", "objects": [], "creatures": [], "interactions": [{"character": "Emma", "object": "LOC001", "where": "walks across the wet stones", "action": "walking across the stones", "storyRelevant": true, "priority": "essential"}], "wornItems": []}

Looking down from a high angle onto the churn of dark evening water between the wet coastal stones, the large sea turtle Kora rises directly into the gap, her segmented tan and dark brown shell creating a broad, stable surface just beneath the surface, her head lifted with gentle brown eyes and a calm closed beak. Emma, a little girl with brown wavy ear-length hair in a ponytail, brown eyes, freckles, wearing a red knitted wool sweater, black denim leggings, and yellow rubber rain boots, leans forward from the stone edge, both hands gripped tightly onto the upper rim of Kora's shell, her mouth slightly open in surprise as her boots leave the rock, while Noah, a little boy with blonde wavy ear-length hair with bangs, blue eyes, wearing a yellow hooded sweatshirt, brown corduroy trousers, and brown leather ankle boots, leaps from the stone alongside her, both hands grabbing the outer rim of the shell with his weight carrying him into the dive.

---METADATA---
{"sceneIntent": "Kora surfaces in the stone gap as Emma and Noah grab hold of her wide shell and dive into the water together. The dark water churns around the wet stones in the high-angle view.", "characters": [{"name": "Emma", "clothing": "standard", "position": "at the shell rim", "depth": "foreground", "footing": "swimming", "expression": "brows lifted, eyes wide, mouth parted", "emotion": "surprised"}, {"name": "Noah", "clothing": "standard", "position": "beside Emma at the shell rim", "depth": "foreground", "footing": "swimming", "expression": "brows pulled tight, eyes wide, mouth firm", "emotion": "neutral"}], "era": "present day", "weather": "none", "objects": [], "creatures": [{"id": "ANI001", "depth": "foreground", "looksAt": "Emma", "expression": "brows level, eyes calm, beak closed", "emotion": "neutral"}], "interactions": [{"character": "Emma + Noah", "object": "ANI001", "where": "grips the rim of Kora's shell", "action": "gripping Kora's shell", "hands": true, "storyRelevant": true, "priority": "essential"}], "wornItems": []}

In the vibrant underwater reef beneath the Herbstfelsen, where a towering purple and blue coral archway rises from the pale sandy ocean floor, Mira, a mermaid of adult height with long flowing loose teal-green wavy hair, blue eyes, an open friendly face with lips over her teeth, wearing a fitted top of woven dark green kelp and purple shells with a shimmering green scaled tail replacing her legs, leans forward in the gentle water. Emma, a little girl with brown wavy ear-length hair in a ponytail with a side part, brown eyes, freckles, dressed in a long-sleeve shimmering green scale-patterned top covering her torso and a shimmering green mermaid tail with a wide fanned fin replacing her legs from the waist down, floats facing Mira, looking down with a joyful smile and bright eyes as Mira gently places the knotted brown cord of the pearlescent white spiral singing shell necklace over Emma's head so it settles smoothly against her chest.

---METADATA---
{"sceneIntent": "Mira places the singing shell necklace around Emma's neck in the underwater reef beside a large coral archway. The calm ocean floor spreads below them.", "characters": [{"name": "Emma", "clothing": "costumed:mermaid", "position": "before the coral archway", "depth": "foreground", "footing": "swimming", "expression": "brows relaxed, eyes bright, broad smile", "emotion": "happy"}], "era": "present day", "weather": "none", "objects": [], "creatures": [], "interactions": [{"character": "Emma", "object": "ART002.1", "where": "receives the shell necklace around her neck", "action": "holding", "hands": false, "storyRelevant": true, "priority": "essential"}], "wornItems": [{"id": "ART002", "owner": "Emma", "state": "worn"}]}

Floating in a close-up before a deep textured crack in the underwater coral reef wall, Emma, a little girl with brown wavy ear-length hair in a ponytail with a side part, brown eyes, freckles, wearing a long-sleeve shimmering green scale-patterned top and a shimmering green mermaid tail with a fanned fin, faces right and pulls her hand back toward her shoulder, her fingers wrapped tight around the glossy dark brown chestnut to shield it from view. Opposite her, the small reddish-orange octopus Oskar, melon-sized with round friendly blue eyes, an open gentle mouth, and pale yellow suction cups along his relaxed arms, extends one flexible tentacle toward her knuckles, his large eyes fixed on the round seed while Emma's brows pull tight with an annoyed, protective frown.

---METADATA---
{"sceneIntent": "Oskar reaches a tentacle toward the chestnut in Emma's hand while Emma pulls it away defensively in front of the reef wall crack. The sandy floor lies just below.", "characters": [{"name": "Emma", "clothing": "costumed:mermaid", "position": "in front of the reef crack", "depth": "foreground", "footing": "swimming", "expression": "brows lowered, eyes narrowed, lips pressed tight", "emotion": "disgusted"}], "era": "present day", "weather": "none", "objects": [], "creatures": [{"id": "ANI002", "depth": "foreground", "looksAt": "Emma", "expression": "brows raised, eyes wide, mouth rounded", "emotion": "surprised"}], "interactions": [{"character": "Emma", "object": "ART001", "where": "pulls the chestnut away from Oskar", "action": "holding", "hands": true, "storyRelevant": true, "priority": "essential"}, {"character": "ANI002", "object": "ART001", "where": "reaches toward the chestnut", "action": "reaching for the chestnut", "hands": false, "storyRelevant": true, "priority": "normal"}], "wornItems": [{"id": "ART002", "owner": "Emma", "state": "worn"}]}

Seen from an over-the-shoulder perspective behind Noah, showing the back of his head with wavy ear-length blonde hair, the crew collar and right sleeve of his short-sleeve shimmering orange scale-embossed top, Noah reaches his arm outward into the swirling murky water. In the midground ahead, thick billowing clouds of black octopus ink spread through the dark water, where the reddish-orange octopus Oskar dartingly retreats, his round blue eyes wide with mischief as two of his flexible arms hold the thin brown cord of the pearlescent white singing shell necklace high in the water above the swirling dark plumes.

---METADATA---
