In a wide view of the autumn shoreline crossing under the rich colours of the dusk sky, Emma, Noah, Daniel, and Sarah stand together on the flat grey stones at the water's edge, while Hans stands beside them looking out to sea. Emma, in her red sweater, black leggings, and yellow boots, waves with a bright smile toward the shallows, where Mira, the adult mermaid with long loose teal-green wavy hair and a shimmering green tail, lifts her head and one hand above the calm surface with an open, friendly smile. Beside Mira, the sea turtle Kora lifts one large olive-green flipper in farewell, while the small reddish-orange octopus Oskar perches happily on her domed shell, waving the shiny dark brown chestnut high with one tentacle as the autumn water ripples around them.

